        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John F. Kennedy Jr., John F. Kennedy, Jacqueline Kennedy, Caroline Kennedy, John F. Kennedy Jr.'s wife, John F. Kennedy Jr.'s sister-in-law\n- Organizations: Barnstable County Hospital\n- Places: Barnstable County\n- Topics: autopsy, family relationships, deaths\n\nFacts:\n- John F. Kennedy Jr. was a son of President John F. Kennedy and First Lady Jacqueline Kennedy.\n- John F. Kennedy Jr. was the younger brother of Caroline Kennedy, who later served as Ambassador to Japan.\n- After the deaths of John F. Kennedy Jr., his wife, and her sister, Barnstable County Hospital was the location of their autopsies.",
